.env
.env.*
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*credential*
*secret*
*stripe*
*elevenlabs*

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

